{"v":1,"id":"77d60fe8f665","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"There's a line drawn in the silence","s":17.08,"e":20.12},{"t":"Not by feeling, not by sight","s":20.66,"e":23.42},{"t":"Where the heart reveals its master","s":23.42,"e":27.02},{"t":"In the choices that it hides","s":27.02,"e":30.08},{"t":"Not in words that sound convincing","s":30.08,"e":33.46},{"t":"Not in what I claim to be","s":33.46,"e":36.84},{"t":"But in every quiet moment","s":36.84,"e":40.26},{"t":"What I choose is choosing me","s":40.86,"e":43.86},{"t":"Every path I've called my own","s":49.34,"e":52.64},{"t":"Every time I took control","s":52.64,"e":55.8},{"t":"Wasn't freedom, wasn't life","s":55.8,"e":59.16},{"t":"Just another throne I stole","s":59.16,"e":62.72},{"t":"Still your call cuts through the noise","s":62.72,"e":66.04},{"t":"Steady, unrelenting truth","s":66.04,"e":69.44},{"t":"No confusion in the question","s":69.44,"e":73.18},{"t":"Will I choose myself for you?","s":74.52,"e":79.42},{"t":"I choose you","s":79.42,"e":83.22},{"t":"Over every other voice","s":83.22,"e":86.56},{"t":"I choose you","s":87.34,"e":89.9},{"t":"Over every selfish choice","s":90.42,"e":93.26},{"t":"Your way, your will","s":93.26,"e":96.04},{"t":"Even when it breaks me through","s":96.04,"e":99.36},{"t":"No more standing in between","s":99.36,"e":103.16},{"t":"I choose you","s":103.16,"e":107.06},{"t":"you've always led through fire and trust not comfort not control teaching hearts to lay it","s":118.46,"e":128.46},{"t":"down not hold tighter to their own it was never just about what i do or what i say","s":128.46,"e":139.14},{"t":"It's who I follow when it's hard","s":139.14,"e":142.58},{"t":"It's who I choose to obey","s":142.58,"e":145.82},{"t":"And I feel that line inside","s":145.82,"e":148.76},{"t":"Where my will and yours divide","s":149.46,"e":152.12},{"t":"Where I have to crucify","s":152.86,"e":155.64},{"t":"Everything I try to hide","s":155.64,"e":159.28},{"t":"No more halfway, no more both","s":159.28,"e":162.32},{"t":"No more living split in two","s":162.32,"e":165.64},{"t":"If I'm standing at that line, I'm stepping over","s":165.64,"e":170.86},{"t":"I choose you","s":170.86,"e":174.8},{"t":"I choose you","s":175.58,"e":178.3},{"t":"Over every other voice","s":178.3,"e":181.58},{"t":"I choose you","s":182.26,"e":184.84},{"t":"Over every selfish choice","s":185.44,"e":188.12},{"t":"Your way, your will","s":188.12,"e":190.98},{"t":"Even when it breaks me through","s":190.98,"e":194.2},{"t":"No more standing in between","s":194.2,"e":198.08},{"t":"I choose you","s":199.1,"e":201.66},{"t":"I choose you","s":205.84,"e":208.4},{"t":"If I choose you, I lose my life","s":212.76,"e":216.66},{"t":"If I lose it, I will find it","s":216.66,"e":220.32},{"t":"Every crown I try to wear","s":220.32,"e":223.06},{"t":"Lay it down and leave it silent","s":223.06,"e":226.66},{"t":"Not my will, not my name","s":226.66,"e":229.9},{"t":"Not my need to be right","s":229.9,"e":233.16},{"t":"I'm done fighting for control","s":233.16,"e":236.22},{"t":"I'm done living in that lie","s":236.22,"e":239.78},{"t":"Take the throne inside my heart","s":239.78,"e":243.16},{"t":"Every part I've held on to","s":243.16,"e":246.64},{"t":"If it's me or if it's you","s":246.64,"e":249.94},{"t":"Let it always be you","s":251.5,"e":254.76},{"t":"When it costs me","s":258.36,"e":260.98},{"t":"I choose you","s":260.98,"e":264.84},{"t":"When it hurts me","s":264.84,"e":267.7},{"t":"I choose you","s":267.7,"e":271.52},{"t":"When I don't understand","s":271.52,"e":274.14},{"t":"I choose you","s":274.14,"e":278.26},{"t":"Your way, your will, no matter how it feels","s":278.26,"e":284.9},{"t":"Your way, your will, this is real","s":285.42,"e":291.2},{"t":"I choose you","s":291.2,"e":295.14},{"t":"Over everything I knew","s":295.72,"e":298.32},{"t":"I choose you","s":298.32,"e":301.74},{"t":"Let my heart be made new","s":301.74,"e":304.92},{"t":"Your way, your will","s":304.92,"e":307.68},{"t":"That's the life I'm running to","s":307.68,"e":310.82},{"t":"No more living for myself","s":310.82,"e":314.68},{"t":"I choose you","s":315.54,"e":318.56}],"match":null}
